    <text>
        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1733_6365.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser freündtlich, nachparlich, grueß, unnd dienst
<lb n="2"/>zuvor, Fürsichtige, Ersame, Weiße, besonders
<lb n="3"/>liebe Freündt, unnd guete Nachparn.
<lb n="4"/>Was E. Ehr. Wht. an unns umb nachlaßung, oder
<lb n="5"/>milterung ihres burgers <persName resp="#ner">Jacob <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wetzers</unclear></persName>
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abgestrafften</unclear> 36. Rhgl. halber intercedendo ge=
<lb n="7"/>langen laßen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solches</unclear> haben wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seines</unclear> in=
<lb n="8"/>halts mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mehrerm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vernomen</unclear>.
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wiewohl</unclear> wir sollich ihr <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">firbittschreiben</unclear>
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">achtung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zunemen</unclear> nit ungenaigt, in ansehung,
<lb n="11"/>unnd betrachtung, das wir E. Ehr. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>. unnd
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuegewandten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> aller freündtwillig=
<lb n="13"/>khait, auch gueter bestendiger nachparschafft,
<lb n="14"/>unnd vertreülicher correspondentz <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorderist</unclear>
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewogen</unclear>; <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wann</unclear> aber bemelts Jacob
<lb n="16"/>Wetzers verbrechen vil anderst, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alls</unclear> er <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vil=</unclear>
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">leicht</unclear> E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ehr</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>. informirt, unnd berichtet,
<lb n="18"/>gestaltet, unnd beschaffen, in dem er nit allain
<lb n="19"/>unsere bestelte, und geschworne diener, die
<lb n="20"/>Kornmeßer, Hüeter, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vögel</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unverschuld=</unclear>
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dingen</unclear> mit schmehlichen wortten iniuriert,
<lb n="22"/>und angetastet, sonder auch unns selbsten, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alls</unclear> der
<lb n="23"/>oberkhait mit offentlichen ungrundt ver=
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">clainerlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuegeredt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alls</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wann</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemain=</unclear>
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> Statt <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-552" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">spital</unclear></orgName> wegen Branden=
<lb n="26"/>burgischen durchzugs erloest, dahero er
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1733_6366.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="27"/>und Andere solchen widerumb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fillen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">muessen</unclear>,
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wirdts</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wol</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darzue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guett</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">biß</unclear> sich
<lb n="29"/>widerumb ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anderer</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Casimirus</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sehen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laste</unclear>,
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Deßgleichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unlangsten</unclear> den <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Preuischen</unclear></placeName>,
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uf</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Iren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Bairischen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kasten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bogs</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darmalen</unclear>
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zwen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">f</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">xr</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">k</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hoeser</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">acht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tag</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darvor</unclear>
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gegolten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abkauft</unclear> und damit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">also</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gwal</unclear>-
<lb n="34"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hochschedlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ufsclag</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemacht</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">das</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Reiche</unclear>,
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">arme</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frembde</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">heimsche</unclear>, sonderlich
<lb n="36"/>aber die Ienigen, die das gantz Jahr uf den besten,
<lb n="37"/>oder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hoechsten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">marckht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dingckh</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Korn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">essen</unclear>, hoch-
<lb n="38"/>lich entgelten, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">empfinden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">muessen</unclear>.
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Dieweil</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dann</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zweiflen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ehr</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>.
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abgedachten</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wetzlers</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hochschedlich</unclear>-
<lb n="41"/>en <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uberfharen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">selbsten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schuldgdig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">miß</unclear>-
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fallen</unclear> tragen, auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dabey</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gantz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">leichtlich</unclear>
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erlernen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abnemmen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khunden</unclear>, das er
<lb n="44"/>ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vil</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hohere</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">straf</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verdient</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hette</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wollen</unclear>
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inen</unclear> gegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">derselben</unclear> nachparlichen er-
<lb n="46"/>pieten, Inordenlich er nit allein zuer schuld-
<lb n="47"/>igen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abrichtung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angeregter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">38</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lb</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">h</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">straf</unclear>,
<lb n="48"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weisen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">halten</unclear>, sonder auch das er sich
<lb n="49"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hinfuero</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etwas</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bescheidenlicher</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear>-
<lb n="50"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dachtlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">reden</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einkhaufung</unclear> der
<lb n="51"/>fruchten erzeigen wolle, mit Oberkheitlich-
<lb n="52"/>em ernst befelhen unnd uferlegen. Wolt-
<lb n="53"/>en <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ehr</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>. zue grundtlichem gegen-
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1733_6367.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="54"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">berichts</unclear> in widerandtworth lenger <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nitt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorhalten</unclear>,
<lb n="55"/>unnd seindt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">denselben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guette</unclear> bestendige nach=
<lb n="56"/>barschafft <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoerweißen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gantz</unclear> willig, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allß</unclear> ge=
<lb n="57"/>naigt. Datum <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <origDate when="1611-09-05" resp="#ner">5. Septembris
<lb n="58"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ao</unclear> 1611</origDate>.
<lb n="59"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-68" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Burgermaister</unclear>, und Rath,
<lb n="60"/>der Statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Uberlingen</unclear></orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1733_6368.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="61"/>Den fürsichtigen, ersamen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> weysen,
<lb n="62"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermaister, unnd Rath, der statt
<lb n="63"/>Sannt Gallen</orgName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnsern</unclear> besonders
<lb n="64"/>lieben freunden, und guotten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachparn</unclear>.
<lb n="65"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">St: Gallen</placeName>.
</p>
